Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:02.80,Default,Mira,0,0,0,,The last train leaves at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:03.60,Default,Jonas,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.00,Default,Mira,0,0,0,,We have thirty seconds to reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:11.50,Default,Jonas,0,0,0,,I thought you said the station was around the corner, not across the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:15.00,Default,Mira,0,0,0,,Take the stairs.\NKeep to the left.\NI'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:23.50,Default,Mira,0,0,0,,Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.00,Default,Jonas,0,0,0,,I can hear the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:29.00,Default,Mira,0,0,0,,Then we still have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.05,0:00:32.00,Default,Jonas,0,0,0,,There is the platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:36.00,Default,Mira,0,0,0,,{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:37.00,Default,Jonas,0,0,0,,The clock has stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:43.00,Default,Mira,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meet me by the ticket office.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:46.00,Default,Mira,0,0,0,,{\b1}Keep the ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:49.00,Default,Mira,0,0,0,,It is our way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:56.00,Default,Jonas,0,0,0,,When the doors open, let everyone get off before we try to squeeze inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:01:00.00,Default,Mira,0,0,0,,Ticket, ticket, TICKET; tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:03.50,Default,Jonas,0,0,0,,tick{\i1}et{\i0} inspectors are on board.
